  "_note": "FTDI UM245R USB-to-parallel-FIFO module (DIP-24 breakout). D0-D7 bidirectional data bus, /RD read strobe (active LOW, pops FIFO on rising edge), WR write strobe (active HIGH — falling edge latches), /TXE transmit FIFO status (LOW = room), /RXF receive FIFO status (LOW = byte waiting), /RESET active LOW. Empty-FIFO trap: repeats last byte, does not return zero. Pin order rationalised for clean wiring (not matching physical FTDI pinout).",
